            "heading": "Key Benefits",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Helps remove plaque and daily buildup<br\/><\/li><li>Helps lift visible tartar gently and effectively<br\/><\/li><li>3D Oscillating Electric Toothbrush reaches where flat brushing can’t<br\/><\/li><li>Water-jet cleaning helps reach tight gaps and hidden corners<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Leaves your mouth feeling fresher and cleaner<\/strong><\/p>",
