          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Use",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Step 1:<\/strong> Start by brushing your teeth with your preferred 5-in-1 toothbrush mode<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 2: <\/strong>Use the Water Flosser Pro to wash away plaque, buildup, and trapped food<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 3:<\/strong> Select your Ultrasonic Cleaner mode and carefully remove visible buildup<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 4: <\/strong>Rinse your mouth and clean each tool with water<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 5: <\/strong>Store everything safely for next use<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "22779142-8db6-4dbf-93b6-ac3fd9d5b799": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s Included",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>1× Water Flosser Pro<br\/><\/li><li>1× Oscillating 5-in-1 Electric Toothbrush<br\/><\/li><li>1× Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner<br\/><\/li><li>3× Replaceable Brush Heads<br\/><\/li><li>4× Unique 360° Rotating Flosser Nozzles<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nbAPbH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Teeth Whitening Kit be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Teeth Whitening Kit is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While the kit is designed to safely whiten your natural teeth, it also helps to remove surface stains on dental restorations. The formula is gentle on all dental materials, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings remain intact while your smile is brightened.<\/p>",
